  "source": "ERCOT 60-Day SCED Disclosure Gen Resource Data (NP3-965), full-year publication-month corpus, rows filtered to delivery year (~60-day publication lag; validation-holdout 2022 and locked-test 2026 rows in adjacent publication files excluded from training years). Per-year basis: 2024/2025 from the 2026-07-21 full-corpus intake (2024-05 sparse; 2025 Nov partial / Dec absent \u2014 disclosed in coverage); 2022 (validation-holdout, data-only) from the post-purge partial slice; 2023 refreshed 2026-08-03 (ercot-157) from the complete delivery-2023 re-upload under data/raw/ercot/SCED/ (315 shards, all 365 delivery days)",
